title: SuperintendentClue0
---
Superintendent: The school mascot has been missing for three days now. I’ve gotten multiple calls from concerned parents already. If Pork Pie isn’t found by the homecoming game, I will hold you personally responsible. #line:superindendent_tutorial_C00
===

title: SuperintendentClue1
---
Superintendent: My stamp? You have one too. You can use it to settle any petty squabbles that arise among the school folk. Just decide who the guilty party is and use the stamp to make it official. Show me you know how it works and we can get out of here. #line:superindendent_tutorial_C01
===

title: SuperintendentClue2
---
Superintendent: This will help me stay connected to you during the day. I’ll be calling you with updates, so stay on your feet.  #line:superindendent_tutorial_C02
===


title: TutorialSuccess
---
Superintendent: Very good, I see you know how to use your stamp. Kids will turn to you to settle their grievances, and you must figure out who is telling the truth and who is lying. Keep an eye out for any clues that could lead to the return of Pork Pie, got it? I’ll be in touch. #line:tutorial_success
===

title: TutorialCall
---
Superintendent: Principal Judge! Terrible news! There's been a theft! The beloved school mascot, Pork Pie, has gone missing. #line:superintendent_tutorialcall_01
Superintendent: The whole school is riled up. Kids are getting into fights left and right. #line:superintendent_tutorialcall_02
Superintendent: Any time there's a commotion, the suspects will be sent to your office. They'll try to explain, but it's your job to figure out the truth. #line:superintendent_tutorialcall_03
Superintendent: Click on a suspect to inspect them and view them through your monocle. Click to ask them about what you see. Clues will be collected in their permanent record. #line:superintendent_tutorialcall_04
Superintendent: Once you've determined who's lying, use that stamp on your desk to expel the guilty party. #line:superintendent_tutorialcall_05
Superintendent: I've left the case file on your desk.  If Pork Pie isn’t found soon, I will hold you personally responsible. #line:superintendent_tutorialcall_06
Superintendent: I hope you're ready, Judge. The first kids are about to enter. #line:superintendent_tutorialcall_07
<<unlock_casefile GameManager>>
===